{"sha": "bcb5c5d5f85a944fff826ada3c2ab1cf40e4738e952679f4f6589a94ac128182", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=10.6cm, height=5.4cm,", "    xmin=0, xmax=25, ymin=-0.25, ymax=1.05,", "    xtick={0, 3.1416, 6.2832, 9.4248, 12.566, 15.708, 18.850,", "      21.991, 25.133},", "    xticklabels={$0$, $\\pi$, $2\\pi$, $3\\pi$, $4\\pi$, $5\\pi$,", "      $6\\pi$, $7\\pi$, $8\\pi$},", "    ytick={0, 1}]", "  \\addplot[omDef!40] coordinates {(0,0) (25,0)};", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=0.02:25, samples=600]", "    {sin(deg(x))/x};", "  \\addplot[omDef, dashed, domain=0.02:25, samples=200]", "    {1/x};", "  \\addplot[omDef, dashed, domain=0.02:25, samples=200]", "    {-1/x};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 被积函数 $\\frac{\\sin x}x$：广义积分", "$\\int_0^\\infty$ 收敛，靠的是相邻拱之间的交替抵消，", "而各拱的面积 $\\abs{\\cdot}$ 大致", "形如 $\\frac2{\\pi k}$ --- 即调和级数：$\\frac{\\sin x}x", "\\notin L^1$。勒贝格可积即绝对可积。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:lebesgue:1}", "(a) 证明单调函数 $\\R \\to \\R$ 是", "博雷尔可测的，并证明（处处可导函数的）导函数", "是博雷尔可测的。", "(b) 证明 $f \\colon X \\to \\R$ 可测，当且仅当 $\\{f > q\\}", "\\in \\mathcal A$ 对每个\\emph{有理数} $q$ 成立。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:lebesgue:2}", "计算下列极限，并给出完整论证：", "\\[", "\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\int_0^{+\\infty}", "\\frac{\\cos x}{(1 + x/n)^{n}}\\,\\dd x,", "\\qquad", "\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\int_0^1 \\frac{n\\,x^{n-1}}{1 + x}\\,\\dd x .", "\\]", "\\emph{（对第二个极限：控制之前先作换元 $u = x^n$。）}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:lebesgue:3}", "(a) 举例说明法图引理中的不等式可以严格成立。", "(b) 以三种方式构造逐点有 $f_n \\to 0$ 且 $\\int f_n = 1$ 的函数列：", "即分别在高度上、宽度上与向无穷远处逃逸。", "各分别违反控制收敛定理的哪一个假设？", "(c) 证明在法图引理中，两侧都不能把 $\\liminf$ 换成", "$\\limsup$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:lebesgue:4}", "(a) 证明 $\\displaystyle\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{x}{\\eu^x -", "1}\\,\\dd x = \\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac1{n^2} = \\frac{\\pi^2}6$", "\\emph{（将 $\\frac1{\\eu^x - 1}$ 展开为等比级数，并", "逐项积分 --- 哪一个定理允许这样做？）}。", "(b)（大二学生之梦）证明", "$\\displaystyle\\int_0^1 x^{-x}\\,\\dd x = \\sum_{n\\geq1}n^{-n}$。", "\\emph{（写出 $x^{-x} = \\eu^{-x\\ln x} = \\sum_k\\frac{(-x\\ln", "x)^k}{k!}$，并计算 $\\int_0^1(-x\\ln x)^k\\dd x$，", "作换元 $x = \\eu^{-u/(k+1)}$，并识别出 $\\Gamma$。）}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:lebesgue:5}", "(a) 证明：若 $f \\geq 0$ 可测且 $\\int f\\,\\dd\\mu = 0$，", "则 $f = 0$ 几乎处处成立。\\emph{（考虑 $\\{f \\geq 1/n\\}$ 及", "马尔可夫不等式：$\\mu(\\{f \\geq a\\}) \\leq \\frac1a\\int f$ ---", "请证明之。）}", "(b) 证明可积函数 $f$ 几乎处处有限。", "(c) 证明：若 $\\int_A f\\,\\dd\\mu = 0$ 对\\emph{每个}", "可测集 $A$，则 $f = 0$ 几乎处处成立。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:lebesgue:6}", "(a) 运用\\cref{thm:b3:lebesgue:riemann}判断下列函数的", "黎曼可积性：$\\mathbf 1_\\Q$；托马埃函数；$\\mathbf", "1_K$，其中 $K$ 为胖康托集（见\\cref{exo:b3:measure:5}）。", "(b) 证明 $\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\abs{\\frac{\\sin x}x}\\,\\dd x =", "+\\infty$，而 $\\lim_{A\\to\\infty}\\int_1^A\\frac{\\sin", "x}x\\,\\dd x$ 存在\\emph{（用分部积分）}：", "广义收敛而不可积。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:lebesgue:7}", "证明 $F(t) = \\int_0^{+\\infty}\\eu^{-x^2}\\cos(tx)\\,\\dd x$", "是 $\\mathcal C^1$ 的（定义在 $\\R$ 上），且满足 $F'(t) = -\\frac t2F(t)$", "\\emph{（用分部积分）}；由此推出 $F(t) =", "F(0)\\,\\eu^{-t^2/4}$。（由周末问题可知 $F(0) = \\frac{\\sqrt\\pi}2$：", "高斯函数本质上就是它自己的傅里叶", "变换 --- \\cref{ch:b3:fouriertransform} 将", "对此进行系统的阐述。）", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:lebesgue:8}", "（弗鲁拉尼）设 $0 < a < b$，证明", "\\[", "\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{\\eu^{-ax} - \\eu^{-bx}}{x}\\,\\dd x =", "\\ln\\frac ba,", "\\]", "将被积函数写成 $\\int_a^b \\eu^{-xt}\\,\\dd t$，并", "利用非负函数理论证明积分次序可以交换", "（\\cref{cor:b3:lebesgue:additivity} 的连续形式 ---", "可预先用托内利定理，或将 $[a,b]$ 等分为 $n$ 份，再", "取极限）。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}